## Verification

`manifest.json` lists the SHA-256 of every file in this pack, including this report.
The SHA-256 of `manifest.json` is printed at collection time and stored in `manifest.sha256`.
Keep a copy of that hash outside the pack, then run:

```
evidencekit verify <pack directory> --expected-manifest-sha256 <hash>
```
